2026-11-07T09:43:30.5885630Z [0m
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5887290Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5888400Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5889030Z 
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5889590Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5891000Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5891890Z 
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5892430Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5893920Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5895100Z 
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5896130Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [351..356])[0m and groups [34m(gid 350)[0m
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5898180Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5899360Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5900340Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5900790Z 
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5901230Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5902030Z 
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5902640Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5903760Z    can use Nix.
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5904070Z 
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5904510Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5905030Z 
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5905790Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5907260Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5909760Z 
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5910370Z I will:
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5910950Z 
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5912520Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5914970Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5916780Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5919160Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5920490Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5922070Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5923620Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5925000Z    /var/root
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5931410Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5933010Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5958390Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T09:43:30.5959980Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
